Journey: demoqa modal, select menu, slider, date picker, web tables and files
Tags: @demoqa
Base URL: https://demoqa.com

Open /modal-dialogs
Click the "Small modal" button
  Expect the "Small Modal" dialog to be open
  Expect the page contains "This is a small modal. It has very less content"
Click the "Close" button
  Expect the "Small Modal" dialog to be closed

Open /select-menu
Select "Green" from #oldSelectMenu
  Expect the value of #oldSelectMenu is "2"

Open /slider
Set the slider to 70
  Expect the slider to be 70
  Expect the value of #sliderValue is "70"

Open /date-picker
Clear #datePickerMonthYearInput
Type "03/15/2027" into #datePickerMonthYearInput
Press Enter
  Expect the value of #datePickerMonthYearInput is "03/15/2027"

Open /webtables
Click the "Add" button
  Expect the "Registration Form" dialog to be open
Type "Ada" into the First Name field
Type "Lovelace" into the Last Name field
Type "ada@example.com" into the name@example.com field
Type "36" into the Age field
Type "5000" into the Salary field
Type "Computing" into the Department field
Click the "Submit" button
  Expect the page contains "ada@example.com"
Type "Lovelace" into the Type to search field
  Expect the page contains "Computing"
  Expect the page does not contain "Cierra"

Open /upload-download
Upload "journeys/data/upload-me.txt" to #uploadFile
  Expect #uploadedFilePath contains "upload-me.txt"
Download the "Download" link as sample
  Expect the download sample exists
  Expect the download sample is named "sampleFile.jpeg"
